cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Heuristic Algorithms: online lecture notes with worked exercises"
abstract: >-
  The lecture notes of the Heuristic Algorithms course: primal and dual bounds and
  the evaluation of heuristics, constructive heuristics, local search,
  metaheuristics and MIP heuristics for combinatorial optimization problems, with
  definitions, propositions and proofs, worked examples, exercises with solutions,
  slides, interactive apps and Colab notebooks.
authors:
